# ClearForgery finding route
:expect-pins 2

# The exact ClearForgery finding route reaches its typed reader duty.
? obliged(Appeals, ReadClearForgeryFindingDuty, ReadClearForgeryFindingStandard).
# => TRUE

# The wrong recipient gains no ClearForgery reader duty.
? obliged(WrongClearForgeryReader, ReadClearForgeryFindingDuty, ReadClearForgeryFindingStandard).
# => FALSE
